One thing that I had thot of was to have armor and weaponry have "hit
points" and that after armor takes a certain amount of damage, it
breaks and falls off.  Enchants would increase the Armor Hit Points
(AHPs); maybe each +1 would double the AHPs.  Larger/nastier baddies
would do more damage and different weaponry would do different damage
to types of armor.  Xans would do double damage against boots.  Cursed
items would take damage faster; burnt/corroded items would have a xx%
chance of immediate destruction.

It keeps you from having a perfect kit and means that as the game goes
along, you still have to work to keep your stuff/acquire mroe stuff.

